{
  "_comment": "二元驗證骨架。每個 eval 為 yes/no 問題，搭配 type 與檔案/指令。harness-engineer 不直接執行此檔，由使用者或 CI 自行跑驗證腳本。",
  "version": "1.0",
  "project": "{{PROJECT_NAME}}",
  "evals": [
    {
      "id": "readme-has-install",
      "question": "README.md 是否含安裝/啟動指令章節？",
      "type": "file-contains",
      "file": "README.md",
      "pattern": "(?m)^##\\s*(安裝|快速啟動|Setup|Install)"
    },
    {
      "id": "claude-md-exists",
      "question": "CLAUDE.md 是否存在？",
      "type": "file-exists",
      "file": "CLAUDE.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "status-recently-updated",
      "question": "status.md 最後修改是否在 7 天內？",
      "type": "file-mtime-within-days",
      "file": "status.md",
      "days": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "no-secrets-in-git",
      "question": "git 追蹤檔是否未含 .env / credentials.json？",
      "type": "command-exit-zero",
      "command": "powershell -NoProfile -Command \"$tracked = git ls-files; if ($tracked -match '(^|/)(\\.env|credentials\\.json|.*\\.pem)$') { exit 1 } else { exit 0 }\""
    },
    {
      "id": "learnings-cards-exist",
      "question": "learnings/cards/ 是否至少有一張卡片，且 INDEX.md 已更新？",
      "type": "file-contains",
      "file": "learnings/INDEX.md",
      "pattern": "\\[\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}\\]"
    }
  ]
}
